# The Go services' Dockerfile only ever ADDs cmd/, internal/, pkg/, go.mod,
# go.sum, keys/, and docs/ — everything else (models, models-tts, and
# minio-data alone are several GB) was still being sent to the Docker daemon
# as build context on every build. Ignore everything, then allowlist just
# what the Dockerfile actually needs.
*
!cmd
!internal
!pkg
!go.mod
!go.sum
!keys
!docs
